nal choice**: Discard **J3** to reduce honor clutter, keep all suited tiles for potential sequences.  \n\n---\n\n**Reason:**  \nJ3 is an honor tile with limited chance to form a pung (only 1 left unseen) and does not contribute to chows. Discarding it preserves my suited tiles, which have more potential to form sequences and improve hand shape toward a standard winning hand. It\u2019s also relatively safe since few J3 remain and no evidence others are collecting dragons heavily.\n\n---\n\n**Answer:** Play J3"}
